194
00:14:04,560 --> 00:14:10,500
“Why yes. I was in the ninth machine gun battalion I was in the seventh infantry until June

195
00:14:10,500 --> 00:14:12,119
1918.

196
00:14:12,119 --> 00:14:17,100
I knew I’d seen you somewhere before.” We talked for a moment about some wet

197
00:14:17,100 --> 00:14:21,719
