00:15:02,100 --> 00:15:05,460
“I’m Gatsby,” he said suddenly.

208
00:15:05,460 --> 00:15:12,238
“What!” I exclaimed. “Oh, I beg your pardon.” “I thought you knew, old sport.

209
00:15:12,238 --> 00:15:17,939
I’m afraid I’m not a very good host.” He smiled understandingly— —much more than

210
00:15:17,939 --> 00:15:19,500
